# CVE-2026-59869 js-yaml 3.14.2 (transitive, build-time) -- DoS via crafted YAML. js-yaml
# is a BUILD-tool transitive dep (^3.14.1), not parsing untrusted runtime input, so DoS
# exposure is low. Fixed in 3.15.0 (safe in-3.x bump). Newly-disclosed CVE blocking ALL
# dev builds; baselined to unblock. FORWARD-FIX tracked: add overrides js-yaml=3.15.0 +
# regen lockfile on node-24 (local node-26 can't regen). platform-overhaul #786.
CVE-2026-59869
# CVE-2026-13149 brace-expansion 1.1.15 (transitive, build-time) -- DoS via crafted input.
# Same class as CVE-2026-59869: build-tool transitive npm dep, not parsing untrusted runtime
# input, low exposure. Fixed in 1.1.16. Part of the same newly-disclosed npm-DoS wave
# blocking dev builds. Forward-fix (override + node-24 lockfile regen) tracked with #786.
CVE-2026-13149

