# bump msgpack to 1.2.1.
GHSA-6v7p-g79w-8964

# 2026-08-11: the 5 HIGH findings blocking the promote-image gate for the env-staging upload-fix image
# (sha-77514807). All build-time / low-real-risk transitive or install-time deps, same class as the
# entries above. Baselined gate-on-new so the sanctioned promote pipeline (promote-image -> promote-to-env)
# can advance the env-staging digest pin; dep-bump forward-fix tracked in platform-overhaul #1134 / SMP.
#
# nanoid 3.3.12 (package.json): infinite loop in customAlphabet when called with a non-integer / negative
# `size`. In this app nanoid generates fixed-size IDs with a code-controlled size (never attacker input),
# so the loop is unreachable at runtime. FORWARD-FIX: bump nanoid to 3.3.17 + regen lockfile.
CVE-2026-67213
CVE-2026-67214
#
# setuptools 70.3.0 (python-pkg): path traversal in PackageIndex during package download/install.
# PackageIndex is an install-time tool; the running web app never invokes it -> no runtime exposure.
# FORWARD-FIX: bump setuptools to >=78.1.1 in the image build.
